//   "... | beyond.yourself F8NWHHW"       (catches via known-tail, was missed by [A-Z0-9]+\s)
//   "... | mass.wise.believed.r F8NWHHW"  (catches via known-tail)
//   "... | great race F8NWHHW"            (catches via known-tail — multi-word middle)
