//   "... | . F8NWHHW"                     (catches via known-tail — punctuation middle)
//   "... | ICY-WARM-MAILDOSO F8NWHHW"     (catches via known-tail)
//   "... | Titan Funding F8NWHHW"         (catches via known-tail)
